fixture tech02_control_carry_toss
doc Control for tech 2 (task 3 review 3): the farthest route with no dash-jump of any kind and one Ember Toss (0 Flame, 12 s cooldown: BUILD.md s6), as tools/replay/gap_reach.gd's carry_toss route finds it. A ground dash flat past the edge, a coyote jump on a carry-over frame (10 u/f), the air jump, the air dash up-right, then the ember thrown up-right and the teleport to it 30 ticks later: the feet reach 1590 u past the edge at the ledge's height, 64 u short of crossing the 1664 u chasm.
room test/chasm
spawn 389 384
frames 260
input
  0 R dash
  1..9 R
  10..53 R jump
  54 R
  55..97 R jump
  98 R U jump dash
  99..113 R jump
  114 R U jump toss
  115..143 R jump
  144 R jump toss
  145..259 R jump
end
expect
  # No dash-jump anywhere: no jump or air jump while a dash runs.
  never 0..259 event.jump=1 dash_frame>0
  never 0..259 event.air_jump=1 dash_frame>0
  at 10 event.jump=1 vx=2560
  at 55 event.air_jump=1
  at 98 event.dash=1
  at 114 event.toss=1
  at 144 event.teleport=1
  mark fall 145..259 event.hazard=1
  at fall-1 x<2144u
  never 0..259 x>2144u ground=1
end
